<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Document</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  td {
    padding: 5px 0;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .line-item-table td:first-child {
    width: 70%;
  }
  .line-item-table td:last-child {
    width: 30%;
    text-align: right;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div class="header">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="max-width: 200px; height: auto;">
    <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 10px;">NEW MEXICO TECH</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">SCIENCE • ENGINEERING • RESEARCH UNIVERSITY</p>
  </div>

  <table style="font-size: 10pt;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;">PURCHASING SERVICES:</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">{{ vendor_name }}</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">{{ vendor_address }}</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">{{ vendor_phone }}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p style="font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 20px;">TAXPAYER IDENTIFICATION REQUEST AND SUBSTANTIVE W-9</p>
  <p style="font-size: 9pt;">NMT REQUIRES THIS FORM BE COMPLETED IN FULL. INCOMPLETE FORMS OR REGULAR W-9 FORM WILL NOT BE PROCESSED</p>
  <p style="font-size: 9pt;">FOREIGN VENDORS SHOULD COMPLETE THIS FORM AND ATTACH THE APPROPRIATE W-8</p>

  <p style="font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 30px;">FEDERAL LAW REQUIRES NMT TO OBTAIN THE INFORMATION REQUESTED WHEN MAKING A REPORTABLE PAYMENT TO A VENDOR. FAILURE TO PROVIDE COMPLETE INFORMATION AS REQUIRED BY THE IRS MAY RESULT IN THE VENDOR PAYMENT SUBJECT TO 30% FEDERAL INCOME TAX WITHHOLDING. THE VENDOR MAY ALSO BE SUBJECT TO A 50% PENALTY IMPOSED BY THE IRS UNDER SECTION 6721.</p>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <table style="font-size: 10pt;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 20%;">LEGAL NAME:</td>
        <td><span data-field="legal_name">{{ legal_name }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>BUSINESS NAME:</td>
        <td><span data-field="business_name">{{ business_name }}</span> (if different from above)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>ORDERING ADDRESS:</td>
        <td><span data-field="ordering_address">{{ ordering_address }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 20%;">CITY:</td>
        <td><span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 20%;">STATE:</td>
        <td><span data-field="state">{{ state }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 20%;">COUNTRY:</td>
        <td><span data-field="country">{{ country }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 20%;">ZIP:</td>
        <td><span data-field="zip">{{ zip }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>TELEPHONE NUMBER:</td>
        <td><span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></td>
        <td>INTERNET ADDRESS:</td>
        <td><span data-field="internet_address">{{ internet_address }}</span></td>
        <td>FAX NUMBER:</td>
        <td><span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span></td>
        <td>EMAIL ADDRESS:</td>
        <td><span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 30px;">REMIT TO ADDRESS (IF DIFFERENT FROM ORDERING ADDRESS):</p>
  <table style="font-size: 10pt;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 20%;">CITY:</td>
      <td><span data-field="remit_city">{{ remit_city }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">STATE:</td>
      <td><span data-field="remit_state">{{ remit_state }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">COUNTRY:</td>
      <td><span data-field="remit_country">{{ remit_country }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">ZIP:</td>
      <td><span data-field="remit_zip">{{ remit_zip }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 30px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;">COMPANY TIN / EIN:</td>
      <td><span data-field="tin_ein">{{ tin_ein }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">DUNS:</td>
      <td><span data-field="duns">{{ duns }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>SSN IF INDIVIDUAL:</td>
      <td><span data-field="ssn_if_individual">{{ ssn_if_individual }}</span></td>
      <td>SOLE PROPRIETOR</td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">BUSINESS TYPE - Please check Business Type - Required</div>
  <table style="font-size: 10pt;">
    <tr>
      <td>( ) CORPORATION (CP)</td>
      <td>( ) FOREIGN GOVERNMENT (FG)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>( ) S CORPORATION (SC)</td>
      <td>( ) FOREIGN SUPPLIER (FS)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>( ) PARTNERSHIP (PT)</td>
      <td>( ) FOREIGN PERFORMED CONTRACT (FP)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>( ) TRUST / ESTATE (TE)</td>
      <td>( ) PUBLIC INSTRUMENT OR PROFIT ORGANIZATION (PP)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>( ) LLC-LIMITED COMPANY (LL) - ( ) PARTNERSHIP ( ) S) CORPORATION ( ) S CORPORATION</td>
      <td>( ) FEDERAL OR STATE GOVERNMENT AGENCY (GV)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>( ) INDIVIDUAL (IN) / SOLE PROPRIETOR (SP) OR SINGLE MEMBER LLC (SP) - Please complete</td>
      <td>the attached Independent Contractor Determination Form on Page 2</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">OWNERSHIP AND / OR SUB CATEGORY - Required</div>
  <table style="font-size: 10pt;">
    <tr>
      <td>( ) SMALL BUSINESS (SB)</td>
      <td>( ) LARGE BUSINESS (LB)</td>
      <td>( ) 8(a) CERTIFIED* (8A)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>( ) SMALL DISADVANTAGED BUSINESS (SD)</td>
      <td>( ) LARGE DISADVANTAGED BUSINESS* (LD)</td>
      <td>( ) HUBZONE SMALL BUS.* (HS)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>( ) WOMEN OWNED SMALL DISADVANTAGED* (WSD)</td>
      <td>( ) WOMEN OWNED LARGE BUSINESS* (WL)</td>
      <td>( ) EDUCATIONAL INSTITUTION (EI)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>( ) DISADVANTAGED BUSINESS (DB)</td>
      <td>( ) AMERICANS WITH DISABILITIES (DW)</td>
      <td>( ) NONPROFIT ORGANIZATION (NPO)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>( ) HISTORICALLY BLACK COLLEGE* (HBC)</td>
      <td>( ) WOMEN OWNED SMALL BUSINESS (WSB)</td>
      <td>( ) FOREIGN PARTNERSHIP (FP)</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">INDEPENDENT CONTRACTOR DETERMINATION (To be completed by Individual or Sole Proprietor). If "yes" is checked, please explain.</div>
  <table style="font-size: 10pt;">
    <tr>
      <td>1. Will NMT determine when, where, or how the work is to be performed?</td>
      <td>Yes</td>
      <td>No</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>2. Will NMT provide any training to the contractor or its employees?</td>
      <td>Yes</td>
      <td>No</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>3. Are the services proposed in this contract currently being performed on the NMT Campus?</td>
      <td>Yes</td>
      <td>No</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>4. Will any current NMT employees be involved in the performance of the proposed services of this contract?</td>
      <td>Yes</td>
      <td>No</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>5. Are the services proposed in this contract a continuation of work from a current or prior contract?</td>
      <td>Yes</td>
      <td>No</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>6. Will the proposed services be performed on NMT property?</td>
      <td>Yes</td>
      <td>No</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>7. Will any NMT owned property or equipment be used in the performance of the proposed services?</td>
      <td>Yes</td>
      <td>No</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>8. Is the contractor allowed to provide the proposed services as a business license/registration?</td>
      <td>Yes</td>
      <td>No</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>9. Please describe the services that you will be providing to NMT.</td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Explanation/ description:</p>
    <div style="border: 1px solid #000; height: 80px; margin-top: 5px;"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 40px;">COMPANY / INDIVIDUAL REPRESENTATIVE</div>
  <table style="font-size: 10pt;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">Print or Type Name and Title of Individual Completing Form</td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;"></td>
      <td>Date</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">* Signature</td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">To be completed by NMT</td>
      <td>Banner Number assigned</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">IRS checked on</td>
      <td>by</td>
      <td>Vendor Codes</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>
</body>
</html>